From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A7om <hatter6822@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests/qtest: Add tests for the raspi5b machine

Test what a guest of the Raspberry Pi 5 relies on at register level:
the RAM sizes, the placeholders of unmodelled blocks, the UART10 IDs,
the GIC's geometry, priority bits and Security Extensions, the system
timer's counter, comparators, reset and migration, the watchdog and
reset status, the mailbox through both VideoCore aliases (including a
buffer outside them), the firmware identity tags, and the RNG200.
---
 MAINTAINERS             | 1 +
 tests/qtest/meson.build | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index da5355f..d2fc7ba 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -1026,6 +1026,7 @@ F: include/hw/*/bcm283*
 F: docs/system/arm/raspi.rst
 F: tests/functional/arm/test_raspi2.py
 F: tests/functional/aarch64/test_raspi*.py
+F: tests/qtest/raspi5b-test.c
 
 Real View
 M: Peter Maydell <peter.maydell@linaro.org>
diff --git a/tests/qtest/meson.build b/tests/qtest/meson.build
index 56ff860..624541e 100644
--- a/tests/qtest/meson.build
+++ b/tests/qtest/meson.build
@@ -267,6 +267,7 @@ qtests_aarch64 = \
   (config_all_devices.has_key('CONFIG_XLNX_ZYNQMP_ARM') ? ['xlnx-can-test', 'fuzz-xlnx-dp-test'] : []) + \
   (config_all_devices.has_key('CONFIG_XLNX_VERSAL') ? ['xlnx-canfd-test', 'xlnx-versal-trng-test'] : []) + \
   (config_all_devices.has_key('CONFIG_RASPI') ? ['bcm2835-dma-test', 'bcm2835-i2c-test'] : []) +  \
+  (config_all_devices.has_key('CONFIG_RASPI5') ? ['raspi5b-test'] : []) +  \
   (config_all_accel.has_key('CONFIG_TCG') and                                            \
    config_all_devices.has_key('CONFIG_TPM_TIS_I2C') ? ['tpm-tis-i2c-test', 'tpm-tis-i2c-swtpm-test'] : []) + \
   (config_all_devices.has_key('CONFIG_ASPEED_SOC') ? qtests_aspeed64 : []) + \
